    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, shoot, and survive in \u201cDerby\u201d, a high-speed rogue-like movement shooter! Play as a roller-skating Blue Heeler armed with a tennis ball launcher, fighting waves of robotic enemies and stacking power-ups. Fast, fluid, and endlessly replayable\u2014 can you out-skate the chaos?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chunk System</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-like RPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling/Attribute System</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Stop Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only thing that stop the game is the pause menu.</p>",
